Dear Mara,

As Juniper mentioned, I'm covering Tarrow while she is on leave. It is a
pleasure to be working with you, and with Delphine, and thank you for
your patience while I came up to speed on the evaluation.

Our three-campus pricing is below: per-seat annual subscription tiers for
TU Saltmarren, TU Kestrow and TU Orrin Valley at list price, based on the
enrolment figures Juniper had on file after Monday's demonstration.

  Penmarq - three-campus pricing, Tarrow University System (list, USD)

  Campus            Seat band          Annual price per seat
  ----------------  -----------------  ---------------------
  TU Saltmarren     2,501 - 7,500      $11.40
  TU Kestrow        7,501 - 15,000     $9.85
  TU Orrin Valley   up to 2,500        $12.90

  One-time implementation fee (all three campuses): $24,000
  Covers SSO configuration, one LMS integration per campus, two
  administrator training sessions per campus and a 30-day onboarding
  period with a named implementation lead.

  Seats are counted as unique active student users per subscription
  year; faculty and staff accounts are included at no additional charge.
  This pricing is valid for 60 days from the date of this email and
  excludes applicable taxes.

On the other open item Juniper passed to me - Delphine's question about
whether Penmarq will commit in writing to no training on student essays:
our legal team is still reviewing the no-training language for student essays; expect an answer next week.
I appreciate how important this is to Saltmarren and to System Legal,
and I would rather send you wording our counsel has approved than a
paraphrase of it.

I would be glad to walk through the figures on a short call at your
convenience.

Kind regards,

